<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>韩国央行将关键利率上调至 3.25%</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bok-hikes-key-rate-to-3-25-video</link><description>韩国央行恢复加息，将基准利率上调25个基点至3.25%。此次加息是在 7 月和 8 月连续加息之后，在 10 月暂停后进行的。彭博社的丹尼·托马斯 (Denny Thomas) 从韩国央行的决定中获得了主要收获。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bok-hikes-key-rate-to-3-25-video'&gt;韩国央行将关键利率上调至 3.25%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BOK Hikes Key Rate to 3.25%&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bok-hikes-key-rate-to-3-25-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:52:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>西班牙选民前往投票站，值得关注的股票和债券</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stocks-and-bonds-to-watch-as-spain-s-voters-head-to-the-polls</link><description>西班牙高涨的股市在本周末的选举中受到很大影响，政府更迭的前景使得银行和公用事业等行业面临的风险最大。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stocks-and-bonds-to-watch-as-spain-s-voters-head-to-the-polls'&gt;西班牙选民前往投票站，值得关注的股票和债券&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks and Bonds to Watch as Spain’s Voters Head to the Polls&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stocks-and-bonds-to-watch-as-spain-s-voters-head-to-the-polls</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks, Nasdaq Futures Climb as AI Trade Rebounds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</link><description>巴基斯坦证券交易所计划明年推出股票期权，为投资者提供另一种工具，让他们押注过去三年增长了两倍的市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options'&gt;中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China-Backed Pakistan Exchange Prepares to Launch Stock Options&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:00:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</link><description>迪拜伊斯兰银行 PJSC 表示，它将收购阿联酋伊斯兰银行 PJSC，该交易将创建世界上最大的上市伊斯兰银行集团之一，资产约为 1,590 亿美元。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant'&gt;迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dubai Seals Deal to Form $159 Billion Islamic Banking Giant&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:48:08 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>